    "record": "2026-10-22T20-25-38Z-did-we-ever-add-a.json",
    "label": "Q19",
    "section": "realistic",
    "mark": "right",
    "note": "The answer is right that JobHunt never built a daily email digest, but it misses that the idea was deferred: JobHunt's scope lists a \"Scheduled push digest\" for later. The tool's search matches exact words, and the question's \"daily email digest\" shared only \"digest\" with that entry, so it ranked too low to be sent to the model. Claim 3 is wrong for the same reason: the scope does mention a digest, in a part the tool never saw. It shows a needed improvement: when a related item exists, the answer should give that context.",
